---
description: Testing — mock MCP by default, coverage areas from blueprint §22
globs: **/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx},tests/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Default

- **Do not** mutate live Cloudflare zones in tests by default.
- Integration tests: mock MCP transport/tools (`whoami`, zones pagination, DNS, purge, dev mode, UAM, WAF, 401/403, 429+Retry-After, 5xx, timeout).

# Required unit areas (§22.1)

Theme/font resolution; Zod IPC schemas; credential redaction; safe MCP value serialization; task queue concurrency; Retry-After; retry eligibility; resource locks; capability mapping; bulk immutable snapshot; task summaries.

# Practice

Add tests **with** each service (§23.15), not only at project end. Dry-run smoke before first live bulk mutation (§22.4).

# Scripts

Use project `npm run test`, `lint`, `typecheck` when present; keep mocks colocated under `tests/` or next to modules per existing convention once scaffolded.
